    "media:imagetext": "ADELTA\nCONNECTION®\nOperated by Sky West\nPASSENGER SAFETY INFORMATION\n\"NO SMOKING\" AND \"FASTEN SEAT BELT\" SIGNS\nFor your safety and comfort, please comply with the \"NO SMOKING\" and\n\"FASTEN SEAT BELT\" signs when they are illuminated. Seat belts should be\nfastened securely. As a precaution against unexpected turbulence, you\nshould keep your seat fastened at all times while seated.\nB\nTO FASTEN\nInsert metal tab into\nmetal buckle until it\nsnaps.\nMETRO\nIl or Ill\nNO SMOKING ALLOWED WHEN OXYGEN IN USE\nTO ADJUST\nPull end of belt until desired\nsecureness is obtained.\nTO REMOVE\nInsert fingers under buckle\nflange and lift upward.\nThe altitudes at which the aircraft operates may\nrequire the use of OXYGEN in the event there is a\nloss of cabin pressure. Should this occur, a crew\nmember will notify you.\n1. Take the mask which is stowed in the seat back\nor under your seat and promptly insert the hose\nplug into OXYGEN outet receptade located\neither (A) overhead or (B) next to seat.\n2. Place mask over your nose and mouth.\nBreathe normally.\n3. Adjust headband to hold mask snugly.\n4. Wear mask until advised by crew to remove it.\nPLEASE DO NOT REMOVE THIS CARD FROM AIRCRAFT",
    "media:imagetext_created": 1787958949,
